{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/s1_sub_018.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/s1_sub_018.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_01",
      "hash64": "2E13479A8E038F9F",
      "text": "我們呀，\\n是一對最恩愛的情侶對吧～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_01",
      "hash64": "A4BEB69B60D0EE99",
      "text": "是啊！像我們這樣\\n無論何時都在一起的情侶，\\r\\n就算在寶可夢界也不存在吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_02",
      "hash64": "2E13489A8E039152",
      "text": "就是說呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_03",
      "hash64": "2E13499A8E039305",
      "text": "……那邊那位！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_04",
      "hash64": "2E13429A8E038720",
      "text": "要是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳找到了\\n像我們這樣恩愛的寶可夢！\\r\\n就帶來給我們看看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_02",
      "hash64": "A4BEB39B60D0E980",
      "text": "我猜是找不到啦！\\n啊哈哈～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_05",
      "hash64": "2E13439A8E0388D3",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳找到了無論何時都在一起的\\n恩愛寶可夢了嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_03",
      "hash64": "A4BEB49B60D0EB33",
      "text": "不可能找得到吧！\\n啊哈哈～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_04",
      "hash64": "A4BEB99B60D0F3B2",
      "text": "這寶可夢……\\n看起來不像是很恩愛的樣子吧！\\r\\n啊哈哈～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_05",
      "hash64": "A4BEBA9B60D0F565",
      "text": "什、什麼？一對鼠！？\\c\\n無論何時都在一起的親密伴侶，\\n兩隻一組而且還很恩愛！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_06",
      "hash64": "A4BEB79B60D0F04C",
      "text": "什、什麼？一家鼠！？\\c\\n因為太過恩愛，\\n連寶貝孩子都生出來了！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_man_07",
      "hash64": "A4BEB89B60D0F1FF",
      "text": "什、什麼？一家鼠！？\\c\\n恩愛到生了２個孩子！？\\n感情好到都一家團圓了！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_06",
      "hash64": "2E13449A8E038A86",
      "text": "沒想到……寶可夢界也有\\n像我們這麼恩愛的情侶呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_woman_07",
      "hash64": "2E13459A8E038C39",
      "text": "謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳帶來給我們看。\\n作為謝禮，我來教[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一個動作。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_018_system_01",
      "hash64": "715C9973D3928E94",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]從情侶那裡\\n學會了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]愛心（右）表情[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]和\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]愛心（左）表情[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
